          "jcr:created": "Fri Jun 02 2023 20:28:21 GMT+0000",
          "gradientDirection": "left-to-right",
          "text": "<h3><span class=\"futura-bold\"><span>Physician workflows</span></span></h3>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\">Manage schedules, personal availability status, privacy and how you are contacted</span></span></li>\n<li><span class=\"fontsize-1-25em\"><span class=\"urw-egyptienne\">Locate and communicate with the nurse and team members supporting your patients, helping to save time with each connection</span></span></li>\n</ul>\n",
